      <p>In most markets, heavy machinery buyers have been served by the big established brands at premium dealer pricing. Over the past decade, the inland-China machinery clusters have grown to world-export scale. Hunan's construction-machinery export value grew 43.7% in 2023, and several firms there sit in the global top 50 by revenue. The opportunity is simple: buy direct from a vetted factory in the right cluster, at the factory-gate price dealers negotiate for themselves.</p>
