        <figcaption style="font-size:0.8125rem;color:#9ca3af;font-style:italic;padding-top:0.5rem;line-height:1.5">A Henan concrete-machinery base near Zhengzhou, with batching plants and mixer trucks built for export. Our Zhengzhou team puts this cluster on our doorstep.</figcaption>
